  #[using="kS fS lS faS laS fD lD faD laD HfS_def HlS_def HfaS_def HlaS_def HfD_def HlD_def Hn HappS HappD Hs HshS HshD Hok HG HI HZS HLS HkS HWS HWD"] Lemma cR_run : forall regs0 M regs,
